@startuml
title Python Phase — Disk Image Construction

actor Make
participant "PY image Builder" as PyBuilder
participant "build/ folder" as BuildDir
participant "output file" as Img

Make -> PyBuilder : python3 disk_image_builder.py build/ base.img size

== Discovery Phase ==

PyBuilder -> PyBuilder : scan app directories build/<app>/
PyBuilder --> PyBuilder : sort apps alphabetically

loop For each directory in build/
    PyBuilder -> PyBuilder: check valid app
end

== Header Creation ==

PyBuilder -> Img : write MAGIC_NUMBER
PyBuilder -> Img : write app_count
PyBuilder -> Img : reserve entries table

== Binary Appending ==

loop For each discovered app
    PyBuilder -> PyBuilder : read app.bin binary content
    PyBuilder -> Img : append binary
    PyBuilder --> PyBuilder : record offset + size
end

== Finalize Entry headers ==

PyBuilder -> Img : seek back to entries table
loop For each app
    PyBuilder -> Img : write (name, offset, size)
end

PyBuilder -> Img : add extra padding, user FS size
PyBuilder --> Make : Image complete

@enduml
